report=['# Search-neighbour extension — 28 October 2026','','J1106 worker evidence, not approval. Detached `j1106-extra-study` completed with exit 0. All 206 selected thumbnail renditions were inspected on 18 contact sheets and manually coded. Nine extra channels; 18 format cohorts. The five required channels remain in the companion report.','','## Coverage and ranking','','Window: '+s['cutoff']+' through '+s['collected']+'. Views/day uses exact fractional age in this extension (no one-day floor). Uploads under one day are flagged as volatile, not excluded. The original five-channel collector used a one-day floor, but none of its selected uploads was younger than one day, so its published ranks are unaffected.','','| Channel | Format | Eligible 90d | Selected distinct | Fast/slow overlap | Coverage |','|---|---|---:|---:|---:|---|']
